102	/* Phase-one Armino build (docs/compose/spec/bk7258-wifi-native.md): Armino's
103	 * pm_hardware_init() switches the AHBP power domain, which holds the PSRAM,
104	 * off. It runs from board_early_initialize(), after up_initialize(), so the
105	 * PSRAM may only join the heap once it has run: up_initialize() gets nothing
106	 * here and bk7258_armino_early_initialize() adds the region afterwards.
107	 */
